#ETH 32 years old person from Guangzhou, trading cryptocurrency not relying on luck, #BTC  only relying on a set of 'dumb methods' to make a profit for many years!
1⃣️, don't focus on prices! Trading volume is the heartbeat of the market, understanding it counts as real entry;
2⃣️, don't panic after a sharp rise and slow decline (the dealer is accumulating), a large increase in volume with a bearish trend is a trap (bait for shifting positions);
3⃣️, don’t bottom fish after a flash crash; the main force will offload at the end, don't be the one left holding the bag;
4⃣️, low volume is riskier than high volume, sufficient volume on the rise is stable, a quiet market hides a crash;
5⃣️, don’t rush in when volume increases at the bottom; a sustained consolidation is a true reversal, slower is more stable;
6⃣️, trading cryptocurrencies is about trading people's hearts! Volume reflects consensus, price hides emotions; understand the volume to catch the rhythm;
7⃣️, the highest realm: not greedy, not afraid, not anxious, able to hold cash and wait, dare to charge decisively!

